## 9. CJK Zeroization Supplementary Record (S8.4 Residual, 2026-10-11)

Background: After S8.4 scene restructuring, 14 CJK literals remained in game_app.rs's render_vs/render_message/render_saveload (battle / victory! / save file / etc.). In this round, all have been migrated to `assets/data/strings.json`; the .rs side was changed to call `i18n::sget` / `i18n::sgetf`, and check_hardcode strict is now 0 hits.

### Change details (crates/ti-app/src/game_app.rs)
- render_vs: title -> sget(scene.vs.title); 3 format strings for player HP/BOSS HP/round -> sgetf(scene.vs.player_hp_fmt / boss_hp_fmt / rounds_fmt);
  victory/defeat/press attack key/no battle/attack back -> sget(scene.vs.victory / defeat / awaiting / empty / hint)
- render_message: page nav hint -> sget(scene.message.nav_hint)
- render_saveload: title -> sget(scene.saveload.title); slot_fmt -> sgetf(slot.label_fmt + slot.has/slot.empty); gold -> sgetf(hud.gold_fmt); nav -> sget(scene.saveload.nav_hint)

### keys added/verified (assets/data/strings.json, total 88 keys)
scene.vs.{title,player_hp_fmt,boss_hp_fmt,rounds_fmt,victory,defeat,awaiting,empty,hint}
scene.message.nav_hint, scene.saveload.{title,nav_hint}, slot.{label_fmt,has,empty}, hud.gold_fmt

